# Build-time FALLBACK for a local production build. CI does not read these.
#
# IT USED TO CALL ITSELF "the production (beta) build", which stopped being true
# when a second environment appeared (wordle-teams-qjh3). There is no
# .env.development beside this file and there is no mode switch: BOTH
# environments' build values come from wrangler.jsonc, via
# scripts/print-build-env.mjs, which prints the selected environment's VITE_ vars
# as shell assignments that `set -a` exports before vite runs
# (.github/workflows/deploy-v2.yml, wordle-teams-qjh3.5).
#
# process.env BEATS THIS FILE in vite's loadEnv, which is the whole mechanism —
# it is what lets one committed file coexist with two environments instead of
# needing one file each. So in CI every value below is overridden, and
# VITE_CONVEX_URL is overridden twice: once by print-build-env.mjs and again by
# `convex deploy --cmd-url-env-var-name`, which injects the URL of whatever
# deployment the deploy key points at. vite.config.ts's convexDeploymentGuard
# FAILS THE BUILD when those two disagree, which is the case where a job selected
# one environment while holding the other's key.
#
# WHAT THAT MEANS FOR YOU: editing this file changes a LOCAL `pnpm build` and
# nothing that ships. To change what a deployed bundle points at, edit
# wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed values reach the client bundle, and they are inlined at
# BUILD time — wrangler vars never reach import.meta.env, which is why these are
# duplicated in wrangler.jsonc rather than living in only one place.
#
# Every value here is public. The Convex URLs are addressed by every browser
# that loads the app, and a Sentry DSN is embedded in every client bundle by
# design — it permits event ingestion, never reads. Hence committed.

# Convex production deployment: fabulous-goldfish-949 (wt-ksh.1.9).
# Per the v2 design this deployment BECOMES production at cutover — beta is not
# a throwaway environment, so these URLs outlive Phase 8.
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://fabulous-goldfish-949.convex.cloud
VITE_CONVEX_SITE_URL=https://fabulous-goldfish-949.convex.site

# VITE_SITE_URL was deleted 2026-09-28 (wordle-teams-qjh3.2): nothing read it.

VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://b709a5bb4e96c621ab3267a5efc1dbfa@o177762.ingest.us.sentry.io/4511848703918080
